                                        <span class="badge badge-warning">18:00</span>
                                    </div>
                                    <div style="flex: 1;">
                                        <h6 class="mb-1 text-white font-weight-bold" style="font-size: 0.85rem; line-height: 1.3;">Mentoring Green Business Challenge</h6>
                                        <div class="small text-white-50" style="font-size: 0.75rem;">
                                            <i class="fa fa-user mr-1"></i> Khoa KT &bull;
